CHAPTER.VERS:
In all places in which I have walked with all the sons of Israel, did I speak a word with any of the tribes of Israel, whom I commanded to be shepherd of my people Israel, saying, Why have you

          {+}
         not built me a house of cedar?

And what other nation on earth is like your people Israel, whose God went and redeemed a people for himself, and made a name for himself, and did great and awesome things for you

          {+}
         to drive out nations and their gods before your people, whom you redeemed to yourself from Egypt?
